# The IAM Roles Anywhere credential helper the image carries (ADR 0026): aws_signing_helper, built
# from the commit that tag v1.8.6 of the public repository is. The commit, not the tag, is the pin:
# build.sh fetches that object and fails unless HEAD is it, and a tag can be moved. GO_TOOLCHAIN
# is the Go release the build runs with (a go command that is not that version downloads it).
#
# Moved by: the PM, in a pull request that reruns `make image` and `make image-repro` and the QEMU
# test that has the helper read the Node Agent's pair, when an advisory is published for the
# pinned release or aurora asks for a feature of a later one. No bot proposes it.
ROLESANYWHERE_REPO=https://github.com/aws/rolesanywhere-credential-helper
ROLESANYWHERE_VERSION=1.8.6
ROLESANYWHERE_COMMIT=f17999e83885205544bda00553ffb907a16bf862
GO_TOOLCHAIN=go1.27.3
